# The image needs exactly one file from this repository: the linux/amd64
# collector binary that CI has already built. Excluding everything else keeps
# the upload small and, more importantly, stops unrelated edits — the OCB
# manifest, workflows, documentation, git metadata, local build output — from
# invalidating the layer cache on every commit.
#
# The catch-all matches dotfiles too (Docker's matcher is not a shell glob), so
# .git and .github need no separate entry.
*
!otelcol-otelbox_linux_amd64
